            "review_title": "Review at Vit Tiem",
            "review_text": "Stephystephy\nHong Kong, China108 contributions\n0\nTasty\nApr 2019 • Couples\nAfter reading the reviews and for a change after repeatedly eating bun and com and pho all the time we travelled to Vietnam, we went for dinner after our snorkelling trip.\n\nOf course, we order the famous duck pot with bun and cabbage. The duck, I supposed is cooked and they reheat it for us. Its very tender and there are a lot of ingredients(red dates, lotus seed, mushroom, etc) in it making it very tasty. We added cabbage and bun to complete the meal. The pot is more than enough for the 2 of us!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 13, 2019",
